                "start": 30
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Respondent (Curtis E. Gannon), according to Respondent (Curtis E. Gannon), the agreement expressly contemplates that the judge needs to determine the applicable guideline range for purposes of determining what the fine will be."
